repository-code: "https://github.com/Maxwellson/igra-adversarial-ml-governance"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of IGRA (Integrated Governance Response
  Algorithm), the synthetic fairness dataset generator, the WDBC attack
  code (FGSM, PGD, label-flipping poisoning), and the scripts that
  reproduce every experimental table and results figure in the associated
  article. Includes a verification script that checks 53 reported
  quantities against the code's own output.
keywords:
  - adversarial machine learning
  - AI governance
  - risk fusion
  - accountability
  - fairness
  - response selection
  - reproducibility
